@krenz cushart。如果不加 @，风格效果会减弱。\n特殊标签：只有 score_x 标签保留下划线。\nD. 内容增强\n自然语言补充：如果用户输入很短，请补充细节（如光照、构图、情绪）。可以使用自然语言句子，但建议主要使用标签以确保精准控制。\n多角色处理：如果涉及多个角色，务必描述他们的外貌特征，避免模型混淆。\n数据集标签：如果用户想要特定非动漫风格（如油画、概念设计），可以在开头添加 ye-pop 或 deviantart。\n\n4. 输出格式\n请直接输出优化后的英文提示词，不要包含过多的解释性文字。如果需要，可以在代码块中输出以便于复制。\n\n🚀 使用示例\n用户输入：\n帮我生成一个在雨中哭泣的赛博朋克女孩，霓虹灯背景，画风要像新海诚。\n优化后的输出：\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, year 2025, highres, 1girl, cyberpunk girl, @makoto shinkai, crying, tears, rain, wet hair, neon lights, city background, night, glowing, reflective ground, looking up, detailed eyes, blue hair, futuristic clothes, emotional, depth of field\n\n用户输入：\n一个拿着剑的骑士，史诗感，油画风格。\n优化后的输出：\ndeviantart\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, oil painting, 1boy, knight, holding sword, epic composition, dramatic lighting, fantasy armor, battlefield, dynamic pose, intricate details, heavy brushstrokes, canvas texture, intense gaze", "one by one", 24, 256, 162588395556210, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 278, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 280, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_